- 2026-11-20 21:20 PST, thread 1567745029781454889 (Osama, after his host crash at 21:13 lost the last 1 min 45 s of log: "yeah 1 minute is better, and upon closing
  maybe?"). RUNTIME: LogUpload.cs uploads the game log every 1 minute in battle (was 5) and keeps 5 minutes in the menus; entering a battle brings the next upload
  to within 1 minute. The upload at a clean close (LogUpload.Quit) already existed and is unchanged; a crash cannot upload, so at most ~1 minute is lost. Needs the
  runtime DLL rebuild in the build. Compiles (dotnet build, 0 errors). Not yet seen in game.
